course: dictionary
lesson: 14766
title: The prostate gland
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words name a part of the body. The prostate is one of them. It is a small gland, which means a body part that makes a liquid. It is found only in men and boys, under the bladder, the bag that stores wee. «The doctor said Grandad's prostate needed a check.» The context tells you the prostate is a body part, and that it belongs to men.
explain: The prostate helps make a liquid that is used in making babies. Prostate is a noun, so it names a thing: the prostate, the prostate gland. Try it in the sentence: «The doctor checked his prostate» still makes sense, so the word fits.
explain: Health talk often puts the word with other words: «prostate cancer», «enlarged prostate», «prostate test». The word before it tells you what is wrong, or what is being checked. Prostate cancer is an illness of this gland, and it is common in older men.
fact: Prostate means a small gland in men and boys.
fact: The prostate sits under the bladder, which stores wee.
fact: The prostate helps make a liquid that is used in making babies.
fact: «Prostate cancer» is an illness of this gland, common in older men.
fact: Doctors may give a prostate test to check how the gland is doing.
exercise: «The doctor gave Grandad a prostate test at his check-up.» What is the prostate? | *A small gland in men and boys, under the bladder | A type of food | A sort of cloud | A bone in the leg
exercise: «Prostate cancer is an illness that is common in older men.» Which group does this illness most often affect? | Young babies | Trees | Dogs | *Older men
exercise: In «The prostate is a small gland under the bladder», which word names the part of the body that stores wee? | under | *bladder | small | gland
test: What does the prostate help make? | *A liquid used in making babies | Cheese | Bricks | Sound waves
test: What does «prostate cancer» mean? | *An illness of the prostate gland, common in older men | A type of bread | A cold that comes in winter | A safe place to rest
exam: Which fact about the prostate is true? | It sits in the arm | It stores food for the body | *It sits under the bladder in men and boys | It is found in cats only
